        "text_X6mrbJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Fitness Superstore offers everything you need to create a powerful home or commercial gym in {{ page.metafields.custom.service_state_name.value }}, from premium remanufactured machines to our exclusive French Fitness brand and fully customizable equipment packages. </p><p>Whether you're designing a small training space or outfitting a full facility, our expert support, nationwide delivery, and high-value pricing make the process seamless.</p><p><strong>Start building your ideal fitness space today. Explore our full range of equipment or contact our team for personalized guidance.</strong> and get it delivered in 1-2 week. We provide Installation and assembly services across all major cities & regions</p>"
